{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Change user element permissions"},"description":"Change the element permissions of a user slot (ADMIN). fill = grant everything, clear = revoke everything (run first). Then per list the ids to GRANT or REVOKE: relay_read, relay_write, pca_read, pca_write, fet_read, fet_write (output ids), input_hit, input_press (input ids). The firmware commands FLIP a bit, so the current map is read first (4.x and Due 3.x) and only the differences are sent - repeating the same call is safe. Long lists are split into several requests (Due 3.x: 255 bytes each). The map is read back and checked.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"clear":{"type":"boolean"},"fill":{"type":"boolean"},"grant":{"properties":{"fet_read":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"fet_write":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"input_hit":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"input_press":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"pca_read":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"pca_write":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"relay_read":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"relay_write":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"}},"type":"object"},"revoke":{"properties":{"fet_read":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"type":"array"},"fet_write":{"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9